WEBVTT

00:02.535 --> 00:05.561
It seems today that all you see

00:05.939 --> 00:09.170
Is violence in movies and sex on TV

00:09.309 --> 00:12.710
But where are those
good old-fashioned values

00:12.946 --> 00:15.471
On which we used to rely?

00:15.949 --> 00:18.645
Lucky there's a family guy

00:19.219 --> 00:22.586
Lucky there's a man who
Positively can do

00:22.722 --> 00:24.155
all the things that make us

00:24.257 --> 00:25.918
Laugh and cry

00:26.026 --> 00:30.690
He's a family guy

00:35.201 --> 00:37.101
On the next episode
ofDeadwood.

00:37.971 --> 00:40.201
- Anything yet?
- No, you?

00:40.373 --> 00:41.362
Nope.

00:41.474 --> 00:42.463
Next Deadwood.

00:43.443 --> 00:45.308
Chris, what're you all dressed up for?

00:45.412 --> 00:49.508
These are my back-to-schooI clothes.
I start high schooI tomorrow.

00:49.616 --> 00:52.779
Oh, boy. You better watch out
for the Freshman Hunt.

00:52.886 --> 00:56.913
Yeah. That's where seniors hunt down
freshmen and nall them with paddles.

00:57.023 --> 01:00.390
Man, remember how much that was,
beating those freshmen silly?

01:01.294 --> 01:02.283
Oh, yeah.

01:02.395 --> 01:04.295
You're not serious, are you?

01:04.397 --> 01:08.128
Chris, I'm just as serious as I was
when I saw PauI Reiser do standup.

01:08.468 --> 01:12.165
What's the deaI with airline food?
