01:12.272 --> 01:14.467
Well, that's not nice.
Those chefs work really hard.

01:14.607 --> 01:17.542
And what's with those Starbucks, huh?
They're everywhere.

01:18.144 --> 01:19.771
Lot of people want coffee.

01:19.879 --> 01:23.144
It's supply and demand. It's the foundation
of our entire economy, PauI.

01:23.483 --> 01:27.351
And who do I talk to about
those long lines at the ATM?

01:27.454 --> 01:28.546
That's what I want to know.

01:29.155 --> 01:30.713
Not me, Mr. Reiser.

01:30.824 --> 01:33.315
