to look for a job today.

01:40.667 --> 01:43.192
Oh, okay. I'll go look for a job, Lois.

01:43.837 --> 01:46.567
What is this? The latest Redbook.

01:49.909 --> 01:51.137
Is she gone?

01:51.311 --> 01:52.710
Them and their squabbling.

01:52.812 --> 01:55.337
Although I suppose they're not
the first couple to have problems.

01:57.217 --> 01:59.276
