the female form to pornography?

02:26.880 --> 02:28.814
Don't you do that.
Don't make this my fault.

02:28.915 --> 02:31.145
It is your fault.
I just want to come home and have dinner.

02:31.251 --> 02:34.550
And have my wife say, "Hello, how was
your day?" That's impossible for you.

02:34.721 --> 02:36.018
- You know what this is about?
- What?

02:36.122 --> 02:39.956
