this family and everything we stand for.

02:40.059 --> 02:42.289
What do we stand for?
Who are we, the Goracks now?

02:42.395 --> 02:43.555
Suddenly you're Cynthia Gorack.

02:43.663 --> 02:46.154
That's what you want, isn't it?
You want to be Cynthia Gorack.

02:46.266 --> 02:50.168
